# README demo: `mise run demo` (starts the lab, builds hush, then runs this tape).
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1180
Set Height 820
Set Padding 18
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "cd examples && export PATH=$PWD/../bin:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "hush run plan.yaml"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 13s
